bifrost-dynamic

Unofficial container packaging of Maxim Bifrost.
Bifrost: Copyright 2025 H3 Labs Inc. Licensed under Apache-2.0.
Upstream: https://github.com/maximhq/bifrost
The exact upstream revision and build inputs are recorded in upstream.env.

This project changes the container build, not Bifrost's Go application source:
- dynamically link the Bifrost executable instead of forcing static ELF linking;
- use an Alpine runtime from the same release series as the Go compiler image;
- include build metadata, license notices, and a separate CI-only native plugin probe.

